<title>UK: Merrill Lynch sets warants on Winterthur.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets warants on Winterthur.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch Capital Markets, Zurich said it has issued five million American-style call warrants on Winterthur Swiss Insurance Company.</p>
<p>Twenty warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    850 CHF		   PREMIUM	16.10 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     3.50 CHF		  GEARING	11.40 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 16.DEC.96-21.AUG.98   PAYDATE	11.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  792 CHF</p>
<p> NOTES</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
